Give RuntimeFS folders first-class treatment on the Welcome page.

Three related changes to the same surface:

- Start list gains Open/Import RuntimeFS Folder, and upstream's Open Folder is
  un-hidden in web now that patch 0002 makes it work.
- Recent entries for rfs: folders drop the parent-path column. A RuntimeFS
  folder is addressed by name alone, so splitRecentLabel always produced a bare
  `~` that told the reader nothing.
- Both carry a `runtimefs` class so they can take their own theme colour, which
  is what now distinguishes a RuntimeFS folder from a local one in Recent.

The className field has to be threaded through the start-entry type to reach
the Start list; Recent builds its element directly.
